{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "893844ad-b685-8c95-be61-2192bac098e1",
  "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:36:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:34:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. I know it's Saturday morning, so you've got the weather line. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Lorraine. Tito Andrade. I know City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number. I'm over at 75 Old Beach Road, by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 75 Old Beach Road. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The catch basin at the corner is totally clogged. Leaves, wicked amount of leaves, just packed on top of it. Water can't go anywhere so it's backing right up into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the drain at the corner is covered in leaves and the water's coming into your driveway. Is it still raining there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tapering off, the nor'easter that came in Friday is basically done today. But the water's just sitting. And the cars, they're slowing to a crawl going through it. Everybody's creeping, throwing wake up onto the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, traffic's crawling through the standing water. Is it getting in the house, or just the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the driveway right now. But it's the same story every time it rains hard. Somebody should be clearing that before a storm, not after. My whole family group chat is blowing up with opinions about it, everybody's got a theory."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I hear you. I'm putting this in as a clogged catch basin at the corner by 75 Old Beach Road, water backing into the driveway, slow traffic. Is there a cross street you'd call that corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the corner right at my place, down toward the beach side. You'll see it, it's the one with the big pile of leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll get it to the crew supervisor. They're stretched thin after the storm, so I can't give you a time, but it's flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, understood. Can somebody call me back when it's done? I'd like to know it actually got cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Best number is 401-555-0161?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one, the landline. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T08:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Andrade. Stay out of that water."
    }
  ],
